### Root Endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Get All Incidency Reports
GET http://localhost:3000/api/incidency-reports

### Create Incidency Report
POST http://localhost:3000/api/incidency-reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "date": "2025-10-27T10:00:00.000Z",
        "VehiculeId": 123,
        "IncidencyId": 1
    }
}

### Get Incidency Report by ID
# Replace :id with a valid ID from the Get All response (e.g., 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/incidency-reports/1

### Update Incidency Report
# Replace :id with a valid ID
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/incidency-reports/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "date": "2026-10-28T12:00:00.000Z",
    "VehiculeId": 123,
    "IncidencyId": 2
}

### Delete Incidency Report
# Replace :id with a valid ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/incidency-reports/19
